&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Container/1.21.0-beta.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Resources.Container v1.21.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated Semantic Conventions version to &lt;code&gt;1.45.0&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5833" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5833/hovercard"&gt;#5833&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
