(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3867" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3867/hovercard"&gt;#3867&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add support for .NET 11.0.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3867" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3867/hovercard"&gt;#3867&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated OpenTelemetry core component version(s) to &lt;code&gt;1.21.0&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5969" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5969/hovercard"&gt;#5969&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;container.id&lt;/code&gt; being reported as the id of the pod sandbox rather than&lt;br&gt;
the id of the container when running in Kubernetes with containerd and&lt;br&gt;
cgroup v2. The id of the pod sandbox is shared by all containers in the pod,&lt;br&gt;
so it is no longer used. The id is now only reported when it can be&lt;br&gt;
determined reliably, which includes CRI-O and containerd cgroup paths.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5947" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5947/hovercard"&gt;#5947&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Resources.Container-1.21.0-beta.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Container/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
